<view class="guide-page">
  <view class="guide-hero">
    <view class="guide-kicker">SINGAPORE SCHOOL GUIDE</view>
    <view class="guide-title">先看清路径，再选择学校。</view>
    <view class="guide-subtitle">政府学校、AEIS和IB学校资料使用MOE与IB官方来源；没有核实的内容不会补写。</view>
    <view class="guide-action-row">
      <button class="guide-action" bindtap="goAssessment">开始测评</button>
      <button class="guide-action secondary" bindtap="goSchools">找学校</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="guide-section">
    <view class="guide-section-title">先选择申请路径</view>
    <view class="guide-section-note">身份、年龄和入学年份会先决定哪些路径可能适用。</view>
    <view class="guide-list">
      <view class="guide-row" wx:for="{{pathways}}" wx:key="slug" data-slug="{{item.slug}}" bindtap="openPathway">
        <view class="guide-row-main">
          <view class="guide-row-title">{{item.title}}</view>
          <view class="guide-row-note">{{item.audience}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="guide-arrow">›</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="guide-section">
    <view class="guide-section-title">官方学校目录</view>
    <view class="guide-section-note">当前收录 {{schools.length}} 条IB官方新加坡目录记录，版本 {{version}}。</view>
    <view class="guide-action-row">
      <button class="guide-action" bindtap="goSchools">浏览目录</button>
      <button class="guide-action secondary" bindtap="goCompare">比较学校</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="guide-notice">资格、出生日期、考试日期、费用和学额会变化。提交申请前必须再次打开对应官方页面核对。</view>
  <button class="guide-action" style="margin-top: 30rpx;" bindtap="goConsult">提交人工评估</button>
</view>
